## SQ-IDS-01 | owner-id lint 0 flagged; no duplicate WTHIT plugin or JEI uid line
@group B (full pack)
@commands `python3 tools/id_owner_lint.py`; prep_srv with the nine builds; boot; `grep -iE "duplicate (plugin\|uid)\|Duplicate plugin\|already registered" logs/latest.log`; `grep -c "creativecommon:\|creativeengineering:" config/waila/plugin_toggle.json5` (client config, after CQ-IDS-01)
@pass lint prints `0 flagged`; boot reaches Done; no duplicate WTHIT plugin or JEI uid line; plugin_toggle holds no `creativecommon:` / `creativeengineering:` rows
@fails an id left in the old namespace; a stale old jar in `mods/`
@from batches/r1113/c3_b1.qb
shell cd "$INST" && python3 tools/id_owner_lint.py | tail -1
shell cd "$INST" && python3 tools/id_owner_lint.py | tail -1 | grep -q "^0 flagged"
# r1114: "already registered" alone matched AE2's INFO "Not registering BaseClass ... is already registered" (igtooltip)
bootreject [Dd]uplicate (plugin|uid)|^(?!.*BaseClassRegistrationImpl).*already registered
look plugin_toggle.json5 half (client config) is CQ-IDS-01's

## SQ-IDS-02 | new commands answer, old names unknown
@group B (same boot)
@commands `/ccswap items`, `/ccaltime`, `/cwglocate batch minecraft:village_plains`, `/cwgspawnbox`, `/cdevgen status`, `/cdevgen run food_dict`, `/cdevplace preview structures minecraft:*`, `/cdevperf`, `/cdevdumpnames`; then each old name (`/ceswap`, `/cetime`, `/celocate`, `/cespawnbox`, `/cegen`, `/ceplace`, `/ceperf`, `/cedumpnames`); perf suite smoke (`tools/perf/suite/perf_suite.py`, 1 bot, 1 minute)
@pass each new command answers (usage or result, no "Unknown command"); each old name is unknown; `/cdevgen run` writes `logs/cdevgen/food_dict.log`; the bot logs in (`pbot status`) and `perf/bot` gains a tick log
@fails a literal left in a jar; a tool still passing `-Dceperfbot.out` or copying `ceperfbot-*.jar`
@from batches/r1113/c3_b1.qb
> ccswap items
> ccaltime
# r1114: the filter is a StringArgumentType.string(): a namespaced id must be quoted
> cwglocate batch "minecraft:village_plains"
> cwgspawnbox
> cdevgen status
> cdevplace preview structures minecraft:*
> cdevperf
# r1114: /cdevdumpnames is a client command (RegisterClientCommandsEvent): unknown on a server, left to the client half
sleep 10
> ceswap
> cetime
> celocate
> cespawnbox
> cegen
> ceplace
> ceperf
> cedumpnames
sleep 3
count Unknown or incomplete command == 8
look each new command printed usage or a result (no "Unknown or incomplete command" before the old names); exactly 8 unknowns = the 8 old names. /cdevgen run food_dict and the perf suite smoke are left out (srv/ has no tools/)

## SQ-IDS-03
@group B (world saved on the 11-06 or 7.19 builds)
@commands before the swap: kettle with water in its tank, nightstand with items, lunchbox with a skin, backpack with a skin, a half-done sequenced assembly item in a chest; swap to the new builds; reload the world; `/data get block` on kettle and nightstand, `/data get block` on the chest
@pass kettle tank keeps fluid and level (`CETankFluid`, `CETankLevel`), nightstand keeps `CENightstandItems`, lunchbox and backpack keep `CELunchboxSkin` / `CESkin`, the assembly item keeps `CEStash`
@fails a saved NBT key renamed with its Java constant
@draft needs a fixture world saved on the 11-06 builds (kettle with water, nightstand, skinned lunchbox and backpack, half-done assembly item) and no fixture builder exists; once built, the reads are `/cdevtest be` on kettle and nightstand and `/cdevtest inv` on the chest, expecting CETankFluid, CENightstandItems, CELunchboxSkin, CESkin, CEStash
