@pass Creative Compat lists its 15 lines (block model icon, coaster, jar contents, hive, servings, campfire, sheetmetal tank, kitchen station, pot and kettle leftovers, sheared, silk touch, operator barriers, flower pot contents, run speed) and Creative Calendar lists Crop Seasons, each with a name (no raw `config.waila.plugin_*`); every line still shows in world
