shot wthit_hive
do {"look": {"from": "4.5 102.6 -1", "at": "4.5 101.3 1.5"}}
shot wthit_pot
do {"look": {"from": "8.5 102.6 -1", "at": "8.5 101.2 1.5"}}
shot wthit_crop
shell grep -c "creativecommon:\|creativeengineering:" config/waila/plugin_toggle.json5; true
look WTHIT lines show in world with names; the WTHIT config Plugins page (by hand): Creative Compat 15 lines and Creative Calendar Crop Seasons, each named (no raw config.waila.plugin_*); shell count 0 (SQ-IDS-01's client half)
