## CQ-IDS-03
@group client (same)
@commands rename a chest to a 40-character name in an anvil; place and open it; `ls -l kubejs/exported/gui_title_overflow.json`
@pass the title plaque stretches to fit; the overflow file gains the chest's entry
@fails TitlePlaques still not subscribed (mod id)
@reviewed 2026-11-16
> setblock 0 101 1 minecraft:chest{CustomName:'{"text":"A chest with a forty character long name"}'}
do {"look": {"from": "0.5 102.6 -1", "at": "0.5 101.5 1.5"}}
do {"use": true}
do {"wait": "screen:ContainerScreen"}
do {"screen_info": true, "expect": "forty character"}
shot chest_title
do {"screen": "close"}
shell ls -l --time-style=+%H:%M:%S kubejs/exported/gui_title_overflow.json; grep -c "forty character\|ContainerScreen\|chest" kubejs/exported/gui_title_overflow.json; true
look the title plaque stretches to fit the name (shot); the overflow file was written now and holds the chest entry
